\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The hybrid. A comment enters two independent branches. The neural branch produces class probabilities; the rule branch produces per-label lexical scores and the spans that produced them. Fusion mixes each channel with its own weight $\alpha _c$, and frozen per-channel thresholds turn the three scores into a label. The evidence record is emitted with the decision and makes the lexical part of the decision inspectable. Weights and thresholds shown are the values selected on validation for the focused backbone.}}{5}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{5}{The hybrid. A comment enters two independent branches. The neural branch produces class probabilities; the rule branch produces per-label lexical scores and the spans that produced them. Fusion mixes each channel with its own weight $\alpha _c$, and frozen per-channel thresholds turn the three scores into a label. The evidence record is emitted with the decision and makes the lexical part of the decision inspectable. Weights and thresholds shown are the values selected on validation for the focused backbone}{figure.1}{}}
