\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Quantitative summary for the focused backbone. (a)~Macro-F1 of every decision variant; the dotted line is AI-only and the green bar is the primary system. (b)~Provenance of the 38 changed decisions: the four correction types and the three regression types. (c)~Behaviour of the rule channel on the test split: coverage, precision when firing, recall on non-\textsc  {clean}{} comments, and false alarms on \textsc  {clean}{}. Values are percentages; raw counts are in the text and in panel~(b).}}{9}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:results}{{2}{9}{Quantitative summary for the focused backbone. (a)~Macro-F1 of every decision variant; the dotted line is AI-only and the green bar is the primary system. (b)~Provenance of the 38 changed decisions: the four correction types and the three regression types. (c)~Behaviour of the rule channel on the test split: coverage, precision when firing, recall on non-\clean {} comments, and false alarms on \clean {}. Values are percentages; raw counts are in the text and in panel~(b)}{figure.2}{}}
